{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "一万五的儿童车，这价格都能买辆二手QQ了，华为和赛力斯真是把消费者当韭菜割。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和工艺可能确实高端，但溢价过高。建议等官方定价，理性消费。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "想起小时候爸爸给我做的木头车，虽然不值钱，但那份爱是无价的。现在孩子真幸福，但价格也让人唏嘘。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "这价格，我选择给孩子买辆真车模型，还能开呢！", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，容易助长攀比之风，不利于孩子成长。家长应该理性引导。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格直接劝退。普通家庭根本承受不起，这明显是收割高收入家庭。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "问界M9儿童车采用1:1复刻，可能包含华为智能技术，成本确实高。但15800元是否合理，还需看配置。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "前排围观，看看这波韭菜好不好割。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "高端儿童玩具定价过高，反映社会消费分层加剧，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质有保障，价格高也正常。支持国货，希望物有所值。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "一万五的儿童车，这价格都够买辆二手QQ了，华为和赛力斯真是把消费者当韭菜割。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和研发可能确实不菲，但15800元是否合理还需市场检验。建议理性看待，等官方定价。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福，但家长压力也大啊。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "15800？不如直接买辆真车给孩子开，还能上牌呢！这波操作我直接笑死。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，容易助长攀比之风，家长应该引导孩子正确价值观，而不是用金钱堆砌。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "作为家长，我肯定不会买这么贵的儿童车，但也能理解有人愿意为品牌和设计买单。只是希望官方能明确价格，别让消费者猜。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "问界M9儿童车1:1复刻，但儿童车的安全标准、材质要求都和真车不同，成本未必高到哪去。这价格更多是品牌溢价。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸，这价格要是真的，估计又是一波韭菜收割。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层和资源分配不均，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，价格高一点也正常，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_081", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和研发投入可能确实高，但15800元是否合理还需市场检验。建议理性看待，等官方定价。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_082", "text": "问界M9儿童版？不如叫‘价格屠夫’版，一刀下去，家长钱包见底。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_083", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，是炫富还是真爱？这种消费观值得反思，别让孩子从小养成攀比心理。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_084", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但看到这个价格直接劝退。希望官方能出个亲民版，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_085", "text": "儿童电动车市场其实有高端需求，但定价需谨慎。参考国际品牌，如法拉利儿童车，价格也在万元级，但配置和品牌溢价不同。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_086", "text": "前排围观，看看这车到底能卖出去几辆，坐等打脸或真香。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_087", "text": "这价格背后反映的是消费升级还是贫富差距？高端儿童玩具的兴起，让我们不得不思考社会资源的分配问题。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_088", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，支持国产高端品牌，价格高一点也合理。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_089", "text": "这价格，是给孩子买车还是给家长买教训？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_090", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，不如去抢钱。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_091", "text": "问界M9儿童版？这是要从小培养尊贵车主吗？建议改名‘富二代的第一台车’。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_092", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具车，容易助长攀比之风，不利于孩子价值观的形成。家长应理性消费。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_093", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格直接劝退。普通家庭哪舍得花一万五给孩子买个玩具？这定价太不接地气了。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_094", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千元，问界这款车如果真卖15800元，可能包含智能交互、安全认证等成本，但溢价依然明显。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_095", "text": "前排围观，看看这车最后能卖出几台。有钱人的世界我不懂，但热闹还是要看的。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_096", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是消费主义对儿童领域的渗透，值得警惕。我们应关注儿童真正的需求，而非物质攀比。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_097", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障，价格高可能因为技术含量高。支持国货，期待更多创新产品。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_098", "text": "这价格都够买辆二手QQ了，给小孩买个玩具车，真是有钱任性。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_099", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是在收割智商税？建议家长们理性消费，别被品牌冲昏头脑。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_100", "text": "虽然价格高，但华为和赛力斯的技术加持，可能确实有独特之处，等官方发布再评价吧。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": 