{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_101", "text": "我家孩子看到问界M9就挪不开眼，要是真能开上同款儿童车，他得多开心啊。虽然贵，但为了孩子也值了。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_102", "text": "15800？不如直接买辆真车，还能上牌。这儿童车怕是能自动驾驶，直接送孩子上学吧。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_103", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，不是爱是害。从小灌输物质攀比，对成长不利。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_104", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买辆好点的儿童车，但这价格直接劝退。希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_105", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，这款车如果真卖15800，可能是定位高端收藏。但要注意，儿童车安全标准是否达标？", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_106", "text": "前排围观，这价格够我买好几台Switch了。坐等土豪晒单。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_107", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是消费主义对儿童领域的渗透。我们该反思，孩子的快乐是否需要用金钱堆砌。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_108", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障。支持国货高端化，让中国品牌走向世界。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_109", "text": "这价格都够买辆二手QQ了，儿童车卖这么贵，怕不是智商税。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_110", "text": "儿童车定价高，但安全性和品质是否匹配？建议官方公布详细配置和认证标准。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_111", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和工艺可能确实高端，但溢价过高。建议等官方定价和详细配置出来再理性评估。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_112", "text": "我家孩子看到这个车眼睛都亮了，但一万五真的买不起。希望官方能出个亲民版，让孩子也能体验一下。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_113", "text": "问界M9儿童版，开出去就是整条街最靓的仔！不过价格嘛，够我买十个手办了。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_114", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，不是爱是害！会让孩子从小养成攀比心理，价值观扭曲。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_115", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买辆好点的儿童车，但这个价格直接劝退。希望官方定价能合理些，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_116", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，这款车1:1复刻M9，可能用了真车同款材料和技术，成本确实高。但15800元还是超出市场预期。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_117", "text": "前排围观，看看这车到底能卖出去几台。有钱人的世界我不懂，但热闹还是要看的。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_118", "text": "这定价背后反映的是消费主义对儿童领域的渗透，值得警惕。我们是否该反思，给孩子的是爱还是物质符号？", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_119", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障。虽然价格高，但这是国产高端品牌的尝试，我们应该支持。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_120", "text": "这价格都够买辆二手QQ了，华为和赛力斯是不是觉得家长的钱都是大风刮来的？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_121", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候爸爸给我做的木头车，虽然简陋但充满爱。现在的孩子真幸福，但价格也让人唏嘘。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_122", "text": "15800？不如直接买辆真车给孩子开，还能上牌呢！这儿童车怕不是镶了金边？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_123", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，容易助长攀比之风，对孩子的价值观形成不利。家长应理性消费。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_124", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但看到这个价格直接劝退。希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_125", "text": "问界M9儿童车1:1复刻，但儿童车的安全标准、材质要求都很高，成本确实不低。不过15800元还是偏高，可能包含品牌溢价。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_126", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等土豪家长晒单，看看这车到底值不值这个价。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_127", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层和资源分配不均的问题。我们应关注儿童教育公平，而非奢侈品化。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_128", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，支持国货！价格虽然高，但物有所值。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_129", "text": "这价格都够我买辆二手奥拓了，儿童车比真车还贵，真是活久见。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_130", "text": "15800元买辆儿童车，不如给孩子报个兴趣班，至少能学点东西。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_131", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和工艺可能确实有溢价，但15800元是否合理还需官方公布详细配置和定价依据。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_132", "text": "想起小时候爸爸给我做的木头小车，虽然不值钱，但那份爱是无价的。现在孩子真幸福，但价格也让人唏嘘。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_133", "text": "15800？不如直接买辆真车给孩子开，还能上牌呢！这儿童车怕是镶了金边吧。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introdu